# Build context hygiene (product image + P2 staging). Never ship
# dependencies, VCS state, local credentials, or evidence into an image.
# NB: the Dockerfiles COPY explicit paths only; this file is defense-in-depth
# so a future `COPY . .` cannot smuggle secrets into a layer.
node_modules/
.git/
.[eE][nN][vV]
.[eE][nN][vV].*
phase0/.env
*.pem
*.key
creds.json
credentials.json
secrets-export.json
*-credentials.csv
*-credentials.json
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
*.ppk
phase0/evidence/
openconnector/
docs/
.github/
dist/
dist-server/
*.log
.DS_Store
